  "summary": "# 15+ years of experience in SP Core & Edge, SP/OTT Data Center & Cloud network and SP Mobility network.\n# Extensive network expertise in network consulting, designing, implementing and troubleshooting.\n# Architecture and solution selling for new business development.\n# Strong network technology background by triple CCIE and JNCIE certifications.\n# Proficient in IP networking (Routing, Switching, Multicast, MPLS, MPLS VPN, Sement Routing, EVPN), Security, 3G/4G Mobile, SDN/NFV and Data Center & Cloud technologies (VXLAN, EVPN, Virtualization, Programmability).\n# Proficient not only in the test methodology on SP Core & Edge and SP Data Center & Cloud solutions but in various testers such as IXIA and STC.\n# Wide range of experience in product certification test (aka BMT) of very strict standard and solution PoC test.\n  - BMT for performance and scale verification. And PoC test for solution verification.\n# Extensive hands-on experiences with Routing and Switching platforms.\n  - Cisco CRS/ASR9K/NCS5K/ASR1K/N9K/N7K/Cat6K/Cat4K and Juniper M/T series.\n# Proven ability to handle technical escalation issues for in-service support and to complete system implementation on schedule.\n# Proven ability to write technical materials and white paper.\n# Strong communication and leadership skills, including planning, goal-setting, resource allocation, objectives negotiation, team management techniques and group problem solving.",
